//------------------------------------------------------------------------
//                        Liepajas 10 Variables (Called in start)
//------------------------------------------------------------------------
title: Liepajas10Variables
---
<<set $HasEnteredLiepajas10 = false>>
<<set $Liepajas10Resolved = false>>

<<set $hasCesuAlus = false>>
<<set $hasLachplesisBeer = false>>

<<set $badPoints = 0>>


//------------------------------------------------------------------------
//                        Entering Liepajas 10
//------------------------------------------------------------------------
title: EnteringLiepajas10
---
<<show_text "QuestTitleLiepajas10">>
<<disable_controls "Player">>
Voice: Who is here? Answer me!
You Freeze
Seems like this time as you break into someones backyard they hear you

<<enable_controls "Player">>
===

//------------------------------------------------------------------------
//                        Entering Liepajas 10
//------------------------------------------------------------------------
title: EnteringLiepajas10Continuation
---
<<disable_controls "Player">>
A voice seeming to come from the house calls out to you
Voice: I know you are there!
-> *say nothing*
	Voice: Really, nothing?
	Voice: Must have been the wind
	<<wait 5>>
	At this point you don't know what to do
	Your leg has a sharp pain and your feet make sound
	Voice: Ha ha, I knew it, Who is this?
	Voice: I have a gun, what do you want?
	You: Is this a designated disaster shelter?
-> Hello, sorry to bother you
	Voice: Hey I'm guessing you usually don't walk in to random backyards and you are here because of the meteor?
	You: Well, yes
Voice: In soviet times this was a designated shelter. Some old documents still reference it.
Voice: So now every couple of disasters there is a smart guy asking to be let in.
Voice: This isn't even a bunker, it's just a house with a basement that was marked as a "bunker" to show "prepairdness" by the Government

What will you do with this information?
-> Ask to be let in anyways
	Voice: Not gonna happen
-> Leave
	You: Alright, I guess see ya.
	Voice: Wait

Voice: I do have a proposition
Voice: I did leave my beer out on the table over there
Voice: If you bring it here so I can drink it, I'll let you in
Voice: When you have it come to the door facing the garden
Voice: There is a small hole to get it through

<<enable_controls "Player">>
<<show_text "ObjectiveGetTheBeer">>
<<set $HasEnteredLiepajas10 = true>>
===

//------------------------------------------------------------------------
//                        LIEPAJAS 10 BUNKER
//------------------------------------------------------------------------
title: Liepajas10Bunker
---
<<disable_controls "Player">>
<<if $HasEnteredLiepajas10 == false>>
	<<jump EnteringLiepajas10Continuation>>
<<endif>>

<<if $Liepajas10Resolved == true>>
    Voice: I already told you. Get lost.
    Voice: You have ruined the day I probably die.
	<<enable_controls "Player">>
	<<stop>>
<<endif>>

Voice: Bring me my beer! I don't have all day down here.

What do you do?
-> Offer a Beer
	Voice: You again? Make it quick.
	<<jump Liepajas10BeerChoice>>
-> Leave
	You: ...This feels like a bad idea anyway.
	You step back into the yard, the soil soft under your feet.
	Somewhere below, the man mutters to himself.
<<enable_controls "Player">>
===

//------------------------------------------------------------------------
//                        Liepajas10BeerChoice
//------------------------------------------------------------------------
title: Liepajas10BeerChoice
---
The basement voice echoes through the cracked concrete walls.

Voice: So? You got it or not?

What do you offer?

-> Give Your (Cesu) Beer
	You pull out a bottle of Cesu Alus.
	The glass is cold, slightly sweaty in your hand.
	You pass it through the opening.
	A long pause.
	Voice: ...
	Voice: What is THIS Garbage.
	The bottle suddenly slips from his hand.
	Glass shatters somewhere below.
	Voice: Are you joking?
	Voice: This is not what I asked for. Get out.
	<<set $badPoints += 1>>
	<<set $Liepajas10Resolved = true>>
	There is a long silence.
	Then laughter.
	Voice: You really thought that would work?
	Voice: Come back when you learn what beer is.
	Voice: Actually no, don't come back ever
	<<complete_and_hide "ItemBeer1" 1>>
	<<complete_and_hide "ObjectiveBringTheBeer" 1>>
	<<complete_and_hide "ObjectiveGetTheBeer" 1>>
	<<complete_and_hide "QuestTitleLiepajas10" 1>>
	<<complete_text "ObjectiveFindBunkerGood1" >>
	<<complete_text "ObjectiveFindBunkerOkay3" >>
-> Give His Lacplesis Beer
	<<if $hasLachplesisBeer == true>>
		<<set $hasLachplesisBeer = false>>
		You carefully take out the bottle — Lacplesis Nefiltretais.
		The label is slightly scratched, condensation dripping down the glass.
		You slide it forward.
		There is silence.
		The bottle suddenly slips from his hand.
		Glass shatters somewhere below.
		Voice: Oh shit... I guess goodbye!
		You: hey let me in.
		Voice: A deal is a deal and I didn't get to drink my beer... so get lost!
		<<complete_and_hide "ItemBeerLacplesis" 1>>
		<<complete_and_hide "ObjectiveBringTheBeer" 1>>
		<<complete_and_hide "ObjectiveGetTheBeer" 1>>
		<<complete_and_hide "QuestTitleLiepajas10" 1>>
		<<complete_text "ObjectiveFindBunkerGood1" >>
		<<complete_text "ObjectiveFindBunkerOkay3" >>
		<<set $Liepajas10Resolved = true>>
	<<else>>
		Voice: Where is it? Liar!
		Voice: I can hear you fumbling around up there, leave if you can't find it.
	<<endif>>
-> Leave
    You: Yeah... I can't find it.
    Voice: Look harder or just make it easier for both of us and leave!
<<enable_controls "Player">>
===

title: GettingBeer
---
<<if $Liepajas10Resolved == true>>
    Voice: No point in doing this anymore
	<<enable_controls "Player">>
	<<stop>>
<<endif>>

<<disable_controls "Player">>

<<set $hasLachplesisBeer = true>>
You get the beer and are ready to bring it back

<<complete_and_hide "ObjectiveGetTheBeer" 2>>
<<show_text "ObjectiveBringTheBeer">>
<<show_text "ItemBeerLacplesis">>
<<hide_text "BeerBottleLacplesis">>

<<enable_controls "Player">>
===

// Script or something to pick up the beer
// Script to check if you have the beer and then giving the beer
// In that script check if you have more beer to give it. and repeat droping
